{"root_text": {"uid": "ja30", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "මුනික ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Nestling Birds ", "uid": "ja31"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Bull Named Black ", "uid": "ja29"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja30' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>3. කුරුංග වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>30. මුනික ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv30' href='#msdiv30'>Msdiv 30</a>“මුණික නම් සූකරයාගේ භොජනය නොකැමති වෙව. කුමක් හෙයින්ද යත්? ඒ මුණික තෙමේ මරණාහාරයන් අනුභව කරයි. මධුරාහාරයට උත්සාහ නොකොට තමා ලත් තෘණපත් කව. මෙය දීර්ඝායුෂ්ක වීමේ ලක්ෂණයයි.”</p>\n<p class='endsutta'>මුනිකජාතකං දසමං.</p>\n<p class='endsection'>කුරුඞ්ගවග්ගො තතියො.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "translation": {"uid": "ja30", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "මුනික ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Nestling Birds ", "uid": "ja31"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Bull Named Black ", "uid": "ja29"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja30' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>3. කුරුංග වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>30. මුනික ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv30' href='#msdiv30'>Msdiv 30</a>“මුණික නම් සූකරයාගේ භොජනය නොකැමති වෙව. කුමක් හෙයින්ද යත්? ඒ මුණික තෙමේ මරණාහාරයන් අනුභව කරයි. මධුරාහාරයට උත්සාහ නොකොට තමා ලත් තෘණපත් කව. මෙය දීර්ඝායුෂ්ක වීමේ ලක්ෂණයයි.”</p>\n<p class='endsutta'>මුනිකජාතකං දසමං.</p>\n<p class='endsection'>කුරුඞ්ගවග්ගො තතියො.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "segmented": false, "suttaplex": {"acronym": "Ja 30", "alt_acronym": null, "volpages": "PTS 1.197", "alt_volpages": null, "uid": "ja30", "blurb": "“Then envy not poor Munika.”—This story was told by the Master while at Jetavana about being seduced by a plump young woman, as will be related in the Thirteenth Book in the Culla-Narada-Kassapa-jataka.", "difficulty": null, "original_title": "Munikajātaka", "root_lang": "pli", "root_lang_name": "Pāli", "type": "leaf", "from": null, "translated_title": "මුනික ජාතක